    The same four shapes in one colour, for the themed icons Android 13 introduced. The
    system tints this layer from the wallpaper and ignores the fill declared here, so only
    the silhouette matters: which is why the accent bar is not distinguished from the caps.
    At a single tint it cannot be, and pretending otherwise would only muddy the shapes.
-->
